program operators

note 词运算符：plus / minus / times / over / modulo，以及比较 `is above`。

to compute with a as a whole number and b as a whole number giving a whole number
    give back (a plus b) times 2 minus b over 2 plus (a modulo 3)
end

to _start
    say the number compute of 7, 4
    say "\n"
    talk to the machine 60 with 0, 0, 0
end
